    "body": "Merged the refreshed #981 branch (`issue/902-document-units` at 28e37ad7, which already carries upstream main 36035af8) into this branch: new head b84374f3 (merge commit only, no new code). The following `git merge upstream/main` was already up to date.\n\nRemerge-diff (`git show --remerge-diff HEAD --stat`): empty - no conflicts, nothing hand-resolved. No goldens moved.\n\nGate (macOS, debug, sccache):\n- app, every lathe suite: lathe_blade_corner 4, lathe_cross_drill 5, lathe_cycle_exit 6, lathe_field_sim 6, lathe_field_tools 2, lathe_nose_tip 6, lathe_post 7, lathe_post_css 10, lathe_post_g76 8, **lathe_post_inch 6**, lathe_post_tormach 8, lathe_post_tormach_thread 7, lathe_spindle_fit 3, lathe_spindle_keyed 6, lathe_spindle_law 8, lathe_stroke 10, lathe_thread_travel 2, lathe_work_spindle 5, lathe_workholding_kinds 10 (+1 ignored, heavy lane), lathe_workholding_live 3, lathe_workholding_mill_post 4, lathe_workholding_rpm 6, sim_lathe_body 5, tormach_lathes 2 - all green\n- app: conformance 6/6, golden_cl 30/30, program_units 7/7, units_migrate 5/5, mcp_units 2/2, mcp 20/20, posting 17/17\n- post: script_fanuc_lathe 15/15, lathe_post_refusals 11/11\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-post -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean\n\nStill stacked: merges after #981. Flagging ready again.\n",
